{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29517","headline":"别薛岩宾 · 李商隐","name":"别薛岩宾","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"曙爽行将拂，晨清坐欲凌。\n别离真不那，风物正相仍。\n漫水任谁照，衰花浅自矜。\n还将两袖泪，同向一窗灯。\n桂树乖真隐，芸香是小惩。\n清规无以况，且用玉壶冰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29517.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29517","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}